cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use d2mz to convert or re-phase your data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: d2mz
authors:
  - family-names: GREFF
    given-names: Stephane
    affiliation: IMBE, Aix-Marseille Universite, Marseille, France
identifiers:
  - type: url
    value: "https://github.com/stephanegreff/d2mz"
repository-code: "https://github.com/stephanegreff/d2mz"
abstract: >-
  Batch Bruker .d (micrOTOF-Q series, BAF) to mzML/mzXML converter with
  lock-mass mass recalibration and precursor re-phasing. Pure Python,
  standard library only.
keywords:
  - mass spectrometry
  - mzML
  - mzXML
  - Bruker
  - qTOF
  - lock-mass recalibration
  - precursor correction
